DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260721
SUMMARY:🍽 Pasta with RAGU
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 20 min\n\nSides: garlic bread\n\nNo meat — swapped from Sausage & Potato Soup (no Italian sausage on hand). Add garlic bread if still have a loaf.\n\nDouble the sauce and freeze half — saves a future dinner. Use any pasta shape.\n\nIngredients:\n• 1.5 lb – 73% Lean / 27% Fat Ground Beef\, 1 lb\n• 1 jar – RAGU Chunky Pasta Sauce\, 24 oz\n• 1 box – bettergoods Bronze Cut Pasta OR Great Value Linguine\, 16 oz\n• 0.25 jar – Great Value Minced Garlic in Water\, 8 oz\n• 1 pkg – Freshness Guaranteed Garlic Bread\, 16 oz
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-07-21-meal@plan.py
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260721
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260722
SUMMARY:🍽 Mac and Cheese + Hot Dogs
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 20 min\n\nSides: sweet corn\n\nSlice the kielbasa into coins and brown in a pan\, then stir into the mac. Add frozen broccoli to the pasta water.\n\nIngredients:\n• 2 box – Kraft Deluxe Mac and Cheese\, 14 oz\n• 1 pkg – Hillshire Farm Polska Kielbasa OR Johnsonville Polish Kielbasa\n• 1 bag – Great Value Frozen Broccoli Florets\, 12 oz\n• 0.25 gal – Great Value Whole Vitamin D Milk\n• 0.25 pkg – Great Value Sweet Cream Salted Butter
END:VEVENT
