SUMMARY:🍽 Kielbasa + Roasted Potatoes
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 30 min\n\nSides: sweet corn\n\nSlice kielbasa into coins\, pan-fry with peppers and onions. Serve over bettergoods roasted potatoes (microwave bag).\n\nIngredients:\n• 1 pkg – Hillshire Farm Polska Kielbasa\, 14 oz\n• 1 bag – bettergoods Oven Roasted Yukon Gold Potatoes with Peppers & Onions\, 20 oz\n• 2 each – Fresh Green Bell Peppers\n• 1 each – Fresh Sweet Onion
