SUMMARY:🍽 Teriyaki Chicken + Rice
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 35 min\n\nSides: frozen broccoli\n\nMarinate chicken Sunday night in Soy Vay\n\nUse the Taylor Farms Teriyaki Meal Kit on busy nights — it's all-in-one. From scratch: chicken thighs\, Soy Vay sauce\, rice\, broccoli.\n\nIngredients:\n• 1 kit – Taylor Farms Fresh Teriyaki Vegetable Meal Kit\, 23 oz (easy mode)\n• 2 lb – Tyson Fresh Chicken Leg Quarters 10 lb OR Chicken Breast\n• 0.5 bottle – Soy Vay Island Teriyaki Marinade & Sauce\, 20 oz\n• 0.5 bag – Great Value Long Grain Enriched Rice\, 5 lb\n• 1 bag – Great Value Frozen Broccoli Florets\, 12 oz
END:VEVENT
