SUMMARY:🍽 Alfredo Pasta with Italian Sausage
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 30 min\n\nSides: frozen broccoli / garlic bread\n\nRolled forward from skipped Aug 18\n\nDrop frozen broccoli into the pasta water the last 3 minutes. Toss everything in the alfredo sauce.\n\nIngredients:\n• 1 pkg – Johnsonville Mild Italian Ground Pork Sausage\, 1 lb\n• 1 jar – Bertolli Alfredo Sauce with Basil\, 15 oz\n• 1 box – bettergoods Pasta OR Penne\, 16 oz\n• 1 bag – Great Value Frozen Broccoli Florets\, 12 oz\n• 1 pkg – Freshness Guaranteed Garlic Bread\, 16 oz
